[327.678504, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompo\u001b[12Ger require tpwd/ke_search\u001b[38G\u001b[39m(check\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49GComposer\u001b[58Gname\u001b[63Gwith\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer show\u001b[39m),\u001b[84Gthen\u001b[89Grun\u001b[93G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6GAdd a \"Search index\u001b[26Gs\"\u001b[29Gstorage folder, and configure th\u001b[62Gee index\u001b[72Gs\u001b[74Gthere: pages (limited to the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bservice/content tree), news\u001b[34G(pointing\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51G\"News\u001b[57Grecords\"\u001b[66Gfolder)\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gfiles\u001b[84G(fileadmin\u001b[95Gdocuments).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GEach indexer adds its tag.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GCreate a filter \"Typ\u001b[27G\" with three options whose tags\u001b[59Gmatch\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gindexers.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GOn page 16, place th\u001b[27G \u001b[1msearch box + results\u001b[22m plugin in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain\u001b[39m. Put the\u001b[73Gfilter\u001b[80Gin\u001b[83G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msidebar\u001b[91G\u001b[39m(the\u001b[96G\"Sidebar\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gright\" layout), or render the fa\u001b[39Gets in\u001b[46Gide your result template.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mConnect the header form.\u001b[22m ke_search reads \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtx_kesearch_pi1[sword]\u001b[39m, not \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mq\u001b[39m. Either \u001b[86Gename\u001b[92Gthe input\u001b[102Gin\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mHeader.fluid.html\u001b[39m (and switch the cHash exclusion\u001b[56Gto \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtx_kesearch_pi1[sword]\u001b[39m), or keep \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mq\u001b[39m and add a\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsmall route enhancer/middleware\u001b[38Gthat\u001b[43Gmaps\u001b