[328.24363, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcheckboxes become a ke_search filter of typ\u001b[49G checkbox.\u001b[60G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe output is Fluid.\u001b[22m You can override the templates in the sit\u001b[68Gpackage,\u001b[77Gthe same way you already do\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor News under\u001b[20G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/\u001b[39m,\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Greproduce\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gmarkup:\u001b[77G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mol.search-results\u001b[39m,\u001b[96G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.badge\u001b[39m,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata-type\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mImplementation steps\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompo\u001b[12Ger require tpwd/ke_search\u001b[38G\u001b[39m(check\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49GComposer\u001b[58Gname\u001b[63Gwith\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer show\u001b[39m),\u001b[84Gthen\u001b[89Grun\u001b[93G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mextension:setup\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6GAdd a \"Search index\u001b[26Gs\"\u001b[29Gstorage folder, and configure th\u001b[62Gee index\u001b[72Gs\u001b[74Gthere: pages (limited to the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bservice/content tree), news\u001b[34G(pointing\u001b[44Gat\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51G\"News\u001b[57Grecords\"\u001b[66Gfolder)\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gfiles\u001b[84G(fileadmin\u001b[95Gdocuments).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GEach indexer adds its tag.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6GCreate a filter \"Typ\u001b[27G\" with three options whose tags\u001b[59Gmatch\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gindexers.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6GOn page 16, place th\u001b[27G \u001b[1msearch box + results\u001b[22m plugin in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain\u001b[39m. Put the\u001b[73Gfilter\u001b[80Gin\u001b[83G\u001b[38;2;177;