Pu\u001b[9G th\u001b[13G template overrides\u001b[33Gunder\u001b[39G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/KeSearch/\u001b[78G\u001b[39mand\u001b[82Gwire\u001b[87Gthem\u001b[92Gthrough\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gsit\u001b[10G set's TypoScript.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B7.\u001b[6GSch\u001b[10Gdule the indexer with the\u001b[36G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mke_search:indexing\u001b[55G\u001b[39mcommand\u001b[63Gin\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gscheduler\u001b[80Gor\u001b[83Gas\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88GDDEV\u001b[93Gcron\u001b[98Gjob.\u001b[103GFor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Ga demo you can also run it by\u001b[36Ghand after import.\u001b[55G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B8.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDistribution content:\u001b[22m add the indexer and\u001b[48Gfilter \u001b[56Gecord\u001b[62G to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisat\u001b[78Gon/data.xml\u001b[90G\u001b[39mso\u001b[93Ga\u001b[95Gfresh\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Binstall has search working.\u001b[34GAdd\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpdftotext\u001b[48G\u001b[39m(poppler-utils)\u001b[64Gto\u001b[67G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.ddev/config.yaml\u001b[85G\u001b[39mwith\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mwebimage_extra_packages\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI checked TER\u001b[17Gfor ke_search's versions;\u001b[43GI haven't installed\u001b[63Git\u001b[66Gor\u001b[69Gtested\u001b[76Gany\u001b[80Gof\u001b[83Gthese\u001b[89Gsteps\u001b[95Ghere\u001b[100Gyet.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWant\u001b[8Gme\u001b[11Gto\u001b[14Ggo\u001b[17Gahead\u001b[23Gwith\u001b[28Git\u001b[31Gas\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gnext\u001b[43Gstage\u001b[49G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m09-search\u001b[39m)?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 32s · done 12:27 PM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mYou're adding site search to t\u001b[69G_search to\u001b[81Gndex\u001b[86Gpages, news and PDFs \u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[