[423.746453, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mConfirmed from TER and Packagist:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gcurrent\u001b[17Gpackage\u001b[25Gis\u001b[28G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mtpwd/ke_search\u001b[22m\u001b[39m.\u001b[44GVersion\u001b[52G7.5.0\u001b[58Gcame\u001b[63Gout\u001b[67Gon\u001b[70G2026-11-13\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gsupports\u001b[94GTYPO3\u001b[100G13\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  and 14.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BIt has about 1.3 M downloads on TER and about 1.2 M on Packagist.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7G older\u001b[14Gpackage,\u001b[23G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mteaminmedias-pluswerk/ke_search\u001b[22m\u001b[39m,\u001b[56Gis\u001b[59Gstill\u001b[65Glisted\u001b[72Gon\u001b[75GPackagist\u001b[85Gwith\u001b[90Gabout\u001b[96G400\u001b[100Gk\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdownloads. That fits the package havi\u001b[43Gg\u001b[45Gmoved\u001b[51Gfrom one\u001b[60Gvendor to another.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mFrom memory:\u001b[16G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Glead\u001b[14Gdeveloper\u001b[24Gfor\u001b[28Gmany\u001b[33Gyears\u001b[39Ghas\u001b[43Gbeen\u001b[48G\u001b[1mChristian Bülter\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \"ke\" stands\u001b[17Gfor\u001b[21G\u001b[1mKennziffer\u001b[22m,\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gagency\u001b[44Gthat\u001b[49Gfirst\u001b[55Gbuilt\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gextension.\u001b[76GIt\u001b[79Gthen\u001b[84Gmoved\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gteam+medias\u001b[105G/\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G+Pluswerk, and is now with \u001b[1mtpwd\u001b[22m, t\u001b[40Ge vendor in the current package\u001b[72Gname.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BIt's\u001b[10Gope\u001b[14G \u001b[16Gource on GitHub\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gth\u001b[40Gre's a paid \u001b[53Gupport and sponsor\u001b[72Gng op\u001b[78Gion (ke_s\u001b[88Garch\u001b[93Gpre\u001b[97Gium).\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo confirm,\u001b[15Gcheck the\u001b[25G\u00