[425.639176, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[1mConfirmed from TER and Packagist:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The current package is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mtpwd/ke_search\u001b[22m\u001b[39m.\u001b[44GVersion\u001b[52G7.5.0\u001b[58Gcame\u001b[63Gout\u001b[67Gon\u001b[70G2026-11-13\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gsupports\u001b[94GTYPO3\u001b[100G13\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand 14.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt has about\u001b[18G1.3\u001b[22GM\u001b[24Gdownloads\u001b[34Gon\u001b[37GTER\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gabout\u001b[51G1.2\u001b[55GM\u001b[57Gon\u001b[60GPackagist.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BAn\u001b[8Golder package, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mteaminmedias-pluswerk/ke_search\u001b[22m\u001b[39m, is still l\u001b[69Ged\u001b[72Gon\u001b[75GPackagist\u001b[85Gwith\u001b[90Gabout\u001b[96G400\u001b[100Gk\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdown\u001b[10Goads. Th\u001b[19Gt fits the package having moved from\u001b[56Gone vendor to an\u001b[73Gther.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mFrom memory:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The lead developer\u001b[24Gfor\u001b[28Gmany\u001b[33Gyears\u001b[39Ghas\u001b[43Gbeen\u001b[48G\u001b[1mChristian Bülter\u001b[22m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\"k\u001b[8G\" stan\u001b[15Gs for \u001b[1mKennziffer\u001b[22m,\u001b[33Gthe agency that first built the extension.\u001b[76GIt\u001b[79Gthen\u001b[84Gmoved\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93Gteam+medias\u001b[105G/\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G+Pluswerk, and is now with \u001b[1mtpwd\u001b[22m, the vendor\u001b[49Gin the current package name.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt's open source o\u001b[24G GitHub, and there's a pa\u001b[50Gd\u001b[52Gsupport a\u001b[62Gd\u001b[64Gsponsori\u001b[73Gg option\u001b[82G(ke_search\u001b[93Gpremium).\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo\u001b[6Gconfirm,\u001b[15Gcheck\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mauthors\u001b[33G\u001b[39mfield\u001b[39Gin\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.jso