01b[13Gask\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gexisting\u001b[30Gserver\u001b[37Gfor\u001b[41Gits\u001b[45Gversion\u001b[53Gin\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60GSolr\u001b[65Gadmin\u001b[71GUI\u001b[74Gor\u001b[77Gat\u001b[80G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/solr/admin/info/system\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCorrection to my last answer:\u001b[22m I said Solr\u001b[45Gcovers PDFs through\u001b[65GTika. That's only half r\u001b[90Gght. T\u001b[97Gka\u001b[100Gis\u001b[103Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsource, but the extension that puts files\u001b[45Gfrom\u001b[50Gfileadmin \u001b[61Gnto the index, \u001b[1mEXT:solrfal\u001b[22m, is a paid\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfundi\u001b[9Gg-contribution extension. Pages and new\u001b[49G are\u001b[54Gfre\u001b[58G wit\u001b[63G Solr. For the \"Documents\" results in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign you'd need \u001b[22Golrfal, unless\u001b[37Gyour\u001b[42Gother\u001b[48Gsites\u001b[54Galready\u001b[62Ghave\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gfunding\u001b[77Gpartnership\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gincludes\u001b[103Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFree\u001b[8Gke_search\u001b[18Gdoes\u001b[23Gindex\u001b[29GPDFs.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSources:                 \u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;5H\u001b[?25h"]
