[673.349227, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B        \u001b[14GComponent\u001b[36G      \u001b[43G       \u001b[51G Version  \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BEXT:solr   \u001b[17G      \u001b[36G14.0.x (latest\u001b[51Gis 14.0.2) \u001b[63G     \u001b[69G      \r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BApache Solr\u001b[17Gserver\u001b[36G\u001b[1m10.0.0\u001b[22m, a hard requirement\u001b[63Gsince\u001b[69G14.0.0\r\u001b[4C\u001b[2BConfigset     \u001b[20G    \u001b[25G     \u001b[36G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mext_solr_14_0_0\r\u001b[8C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mtika (text from PDFs)   \u001b[40G \u001b[42G                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B├\u001b[34G┼\u001b[76G┤\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B│\u001b[5GEXT:solrfal\u001b[17G(indexing\u001b[27Gfiles)\u001b[34G│\u001b[36G14.0,\u001b[42G\u001b[1mfunding contribution, so paid\u001b[76G\u001b[22m│\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B└──────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat this means for your other sites:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIf they'r\u001b[15G on EXT:so\u001b[26Gr 13 or older, their Solr server is\u001b[62Gmost likely\u001b[74G\u001b[1mversion 9\u001b[22m.\u001b[85GThat\u001b[90Gserver\u001b[97Gcan't\u001b[103Ghost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ga cor\u001b[11G for\u001b[16Gthis site.\u001b[27GYou'd\u001b[33Gneed a Solr 10 instance,\u001b[58Gor upgrade th\u001b[73Gshared \u001b[81Gerver\u001b[87Galong with all the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bother sites,\u001b[18Gwhich\u001b[24Galso\u001b[29Gmeans\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Gschema\u001b[44Gupdate\u001b[51Gand\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Gfull\u001b[62Gre-index.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BIf they're alr\u001b[20Gady on TYPO3 14 with\u001b[41GEXT:solr 14, you can add a core f\u001b[77Gthis site to the existing\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bserver.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- You can ask the existing server for its\u001b[45Gversion in the Solr\u001b[65Gadmin\u001b[71GUI or at \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/solr/admin/info/system\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r