[715.762784, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[1mWhat this means for your other sites:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIf t\u001b[11Gy're on EXT:solr\u001b[28G13\u001b[31Gor\u001b[34Golder, their Solr server is most likely \u001b[1mversion 9\u001b[22m.\u001b[85GThat\u001b[90Gserver\u001b[97Gcan't\u001b[103Ghost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  a core for this site. You'd need a Solr 10 instance, or upgrade the shared\u001b[80Gserver\u001b[87Galong\u001b[93Gwith\u001b[98Gall\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gother \u001b[12Gi\u001b[14Ges,\u001b[18Gwhich\u001b[24Galso\u001b[29Gmeans a schema update and\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Gfull\u001b[62Gre-index.\u001b[76G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- If they're already on TYPO3 14 with EXT:solr 14, you can add a core for this\u001b[82Gsite\u001b[87Gto\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gexisting\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gserver.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- You can ask the existing server for its version in the Solr admin UI or at\u001b[80G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/solr/admin/info/system\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCorrection to my last answer:\u001b[22m I said Solr covers PDFs through Tika. That's\u001b[78Gonly\u001b[83Ghalf\u001b[88Gright.\u001b[95GTika\u001b[100Gis\u001b[103Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsource,\u001b[11Gbut\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gextension\u001b[29Gthat\u001b[34Gputs\u001b[39Gfiles\u001b[45Gfrom\u001b[50Gfileadmin\u001b[60Ginto\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gindex,\u001b[76G\u001b[1mEXT:solrfal\u001b[22m,\u001b[89Gis\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gpaid\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfunding-contribution extension. Pages\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gnews\u001b[50Gare\u001b[54Gfree\u001b[59Gwith\u001b[64GSolr.\u001b[70GFor\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78G\"Documents\"\u001b[90Gresults\u001b[98Gin\u001b[101Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign you'd\u001b[16Gneed solrfal, unless your other site\u001b[53G already\u001b[62Ghave\u001b[67Ga funding partnership that includes\u001b[103Git.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFree ke_sea\u001b[15Gch doe\u001b[22G index PDFs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSources:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b]8;id=2yy8pf;https://docs.typo3.org/p/apache-solr-for-typo3/solr/main/en-us/Appendix/VersionMatrix.html\u0007\u001b[94mEXT:solr version matrix\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b]8;id=fcsicj;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr/releases/tag/14.0.0\u0007EXT:solr 14.0.0 release notes\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b]8;id=fcsicl;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr/releases/tag/14.0.2\u0007\u001b[94mEXT:solr 14.0.2 release\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m- \u001b]8;id=y3g043;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr\u0007\u001b[94mEXT:solr README\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 29s · done 12:37 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255moh we dont have a solr core version 10.0 yet. Can we go with ke_search now and replace it with solr \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255monce cores become available?\u001b[39m                                                                            \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GOrche\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mstr\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mating… \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
