[719.183581, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  a core for this site. You'd need a Solr\u001b[45G10\u001b[48Ginstance,\u001b[58Gor\u001b[61Gupgrade\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Gshared\u001b[80Gserver\u001b[87Galong\u001b[93Gwith\u001b[98Gall\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gother sit\u001b[15Gs, which a\u001b[26Gso means a schema update and a full\u001b[62Gre-index.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIf th\u001b[11Gy're\u001b[16Galready on\u001b[27GTYPO3\u001b[33G14 with EXT:solr 14, you\u001b[58Gcan add a cor\u001b[73Gfor thi\u001b[81G site\u001b[87Gto the existing\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bserver.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou can ask th\u001b[20G existing server for\u001b[41Gits version in the Solr admin UI \u001b[77Gat \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/solr/admin/info/system\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mCorrection to my last answer:\u001b[22m I said Solr\u001b[45Gcovers PDFs through\u001b[65GTika.\u001b[71GThat's only half right. Tika is open\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsource,\u001b[11Gbut\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gextension\u001b[29Gthat\u001b[34Gputs\u001b[39Gfiles\u001b[45Gfrom\u001b[50Gfileadmin\u001b[60Ginto\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gindex,\u001b[76G\u001b[1mEXT:solrfal\u001b[22m,\u001b[89Gis\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gpaid\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfunding-contribution extension.\u001b[35GP\u001b[37Gges and\u001b[45Gnews are free with Solr. For \u001b[75Ghe\u001b[78G\"Documents\" results in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign yo\u001b[13G'd n\u001b[18Ged solrfal, unless your othe\u001b[47G sites \u001b[55Glready have a\u001b[69Gfunding partnership\u001b[89Gthat\u001b[94Gincludes\u001b[103Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BFree ke_search does index PDFs\u001b[35G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSources:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b]8;id=2yy8pf;https://docs.typo3.org/p/apache-solr-for-typo3/solr/main/en-us/Appendix/VersionMatrix.html\u0007\u001b[94mEXT:solr version matrix\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m- \u001b]8;id=fcsicj;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr/releases/tag/14.0.0\u0007\u001b[94mEXT:solr 14.0.0 release notes\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b]8;id=fcsicl;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr/releases/tag/14.0.2\u0007EXT:solr 14.0.2 release\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b]8;id=y3g043;https://github.com/TYPO3-Solr/ext-solr\u0007EXT:solr README\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 29s · done 12:37 PM\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255moh we dont have a solr core version 10.0 yet. Can we go with ke_search now and replace it with solr \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255monce cores become available?\u001b[39m                                                                            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
