[1509.076513, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gtest setup ha\u001b[20Gwri\u001b[24Gten.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings you should know\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOnly news shows up for now.\u001b[22m k\u001b[35G_\u001b[37Ge\u001b[39Grc\u001b[42G skips\u001b[49Gpages th\u001b[58Gt have no indexable content, and the service\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpages are still emp\u001b[25Gy. They'll\u001b[36Gappear\u001b[43Gonce\u001b[48Gthey\u001b[53Ghave\u001b[58Gtext.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNothing builds the index automatically.\u001b[45G\u001b[22mRun\u001b[49G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev exec typo3 ke_search:indexing\u001b[84G\u001b[39mafter\u001b[90Gsetup\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100Gafter\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  content changes. There's\u001b[30Gno\u001b[33Gscheduler\u001b[43Gextension\u001b[53Ginstalled,\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Glive\u001b[74Gsite\u001b[79Gwould\u001b[85Gneed\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gcron\u001b[97Gjob.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe search page\u001b[21Gheading still reads \"Search\".\u001b[22m The\u001b[55Gdesign has \"Search results for “…”\"\u001b[91Gas th\u001b[97G heading;\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor now tha\u001b[17G wording appears in th\u001b[40G line abov\u001b[51G t\u001b[54Ge resul\u001b[62Gs.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe search-box\u001b[20Gplug\u001b[26G's \"Filters\" field still refers to the filter by record ID.\u001b[22m It's correct after a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfresh import, where it\u001b[30Gthe only filt\u001b[44Gr, and the README says\u001b[67Gso.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTwo bugs from earlier stages, not fixed:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mThe p\u001b[12Gge IDs in the site se\u001b[34Gtings are wrong on a fresh\u001b[61Ginstal\u001b[68G.\u001b[22m The README says\u001b[86Ga fresh import k\u001b[103Geps\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B the sa\u001b[13Ge IDs, but it doesn't. Search landed on 20 instead of\u001b[67G16,\u001b[71Gso\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gheader\u001b[85Gsearch\u001b[92Gform\u001b[97Gsent\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bpeople\u001b[13Gto\u001b[16G\"Access\u001b[24Gto\u001b[27Ginformation\".\u001b[41GThe\u001b[45Gservice\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Gfooter\u001b[64Gmenus\u001b[70G(22/23)\u001b[78Gand\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86G404\u001b[90Gpage\u001b[95G(33)\u001b[100Gare\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   also off.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[6G\u001b[1mEv\u001b[9Gry n\u001b[14Gws item\u001b[22Ggets th\u001b[31G\"Education\" category on\u001b[55Ga fresh install,\u001b[22m on top of it\u001b[86Greal one.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I fix\u001b[16Gthos\u001b[21G two next? Otherwise I can commit this as \"Stage\u001b[70G09-search\" now.\u001b[86G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 9m 33s · done 12:48 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mSite search now works with the free ke_search, tested on a fresh install, and is ready to commit \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bas \"Stage 09-search\". Your call: should I commit it now, or first fix two earlier-stage bugs that break \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mthe header search on fresh installs? (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
